| case | `main` | `review-head` | proposal below |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| no arguments | 7.08 ms | 242.49 ms | 7.75 ms |
| two scalar arguments | 1,091.36 ms | 2,290.87 ms | 13.38 ms |
| nested input object argument | 4,730.39 ms | 5,885.09 ms | 25.69 ms |

